    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a failed early access game being released as freeware.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mech Merc Company is a 90s-style mech combat simulator with business management elements. Buy and sell mechs, customize your mechs, hire and fire AI pilots, manage your business expenses, and complete tactical objective-based missions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Pilot your massive combat mechs in combat missions. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Customize your mechs with the expansive selection of weapons and equipment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- 21 playable mechs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Run your own mechanized mercenary company.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Choose contracts and complete missions to make money.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Buy and sell mechs and equipment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Salvage mechs and equipment from missions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Hire AI pilots to assist in missions. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Take up to 12 mechs on missions.</p>",
